      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2308,
      "text": "These are the prophets whom Allah has favored from among the descendants of Adam, and from those whom We carried with Noah [in the Ark], and from the descendants of Abraham and Israel [i.e., Jacob], and from those whom We guided and chose. Whenever the verses of the Most Compassionate were recited to them, they fell down in prostration, weeping.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 309,
      "ruku": 267,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": {
        "id": 5,
        "recommended": true,
        "obligatory": false
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2309,
      "text": "But they were succeeded by generations who neglected prayer and pursued their desires; so they will meet their doom[16],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 309,
      "ruku": 267,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2310,
      "text": "except those who repent and believe, and do righteous deeds – it is they who will enter Paradise and they will not be wronged in the least.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 309,
      "ruku": 267,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2311,
      "text": "Gardens of Eternity which the Most Compassionate has promised His slaves who have not seen them. His promise will surely be fulfilled.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 309,
      "ruku": 267,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2312,
      "text": "They will not hear therein any idle talk, except greetings of peace, and they will have their provision morning and evening[17].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 309,
      "ruku": 267,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2313,
      "text": "Such is the Paradise which We will give as an inheritance to those of Our slaves who feared Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
